#: 56e353bb1a184d368a8b0b67f8ebf360
msgid ""
"**Windows** user instructions are `here "
"<https://www.raspberrypi.com/documentation/computers/compute-"
"module.html#set-up-the-host-device>`__ but in short you should:"
msgstr ""
"**Windows** 用户说明见 `此处 "
"<https://www.raspberrypi.com/documentation/computers/compute-"
"module.html#set-up-the-host-device>`__，简要步骤如下："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:43
#: e2b794b1281340868fe901a2e0103d74
msgid ""
"`download and install rpiboot "
"<https://github.com/raspberrypi/usbboot/raw/master/win32/rpiboot_setup.exe>`__"
msgstr ""
"`下载并安装 rpiboot "
"<https://github.com/raspberrypi/usbboot/raw/master/win32/rpiboot_setup.exe>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:44
#: c1336ea5be1847728cd541c98871c32b
msgid ""
"`download and install rpi-imager <https://www.raspberrypi.com/software/>`__"
msgstr "`下载并安装 rpi-imager <https://www.raspberrypi.com/software/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:46
#: add10a8d4be4495c87daba8fb8daa3aa
msgid "On the RPI I/O board"
msgstr "在 RPI I/O 板上"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:48
#: c3b1646f11644ddd87d09e60460f52f7
msgid "Mount the RPI CM4/CM5 on the RPI I/O board"
msgstr "将 RPI CM4/CM5 安装到 RPI I/O 板上"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:49
#: 72a7721b7e814e319eae3e2a6a00f660
msgid ""
"Add jumper so the RPI CM starts in bootloader mode, \"Fit jumper to disable "
"eMMC Boot\""
msgstr "添加跳线使 RPI CM 以引导加载程序模式启动，「安装跳线以禁用 eMMC 启动」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:50
#: b1effca7174b4e29869ed5d9a54c7da4
msgid "Connect I/O board to PC via USB"
msgstr "通过 USB 将 I/O 板连接到 PC"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:51
#: ac4ea6540aa24cef9d4cfeb2f6656538
msgid ""
"Power on the I/O board (if using the RPI5 I/O board this step is probably "
"done by the above step)"
msgstr "为 I/O 板上电（如使用 RPI5 I/O 板，此步骤可能已由上一步完成）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:53
#: e14b04768cad408698ffea6cc886c1eb
msgid "On your PC"
msgstr "在您的 PC 上"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:55
#: d7a3d8e393f44790be56a63183d51f6d
msgid ""
"Open a web browser to the `Rpanion Server release page "
"<https://www.docs.rpanion.com/software/rpanion-server>`__, under \"Disk "
"images\" find and download the appropriate image for your RPI model"
msgstr ""
"用浏览器打开 `Rpanion Server 发布页面 <https://www.docs.rpanion.com/software/rpanion-"
"server>`__，在 \"Disk images\" 下找到并下载适合你 RPI 型号的镜像"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:56
#: 71eaef027a4b4e1f9aae44e3940eb516
msgid "run rpiboot:"
msgstr "运行 rpiboot："

