#: 8dd2fbbbef7b4ef1953032c219fb4a5d
msgid "**Ubuntu** users should open a terminal and enter \"rpiboot\""
msgstr "**Ubuntu** 用户打开终端并输入「rpiboot」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:59
#: 72a6021b558a459eaf1906f41e82fdda
msgid ""
"**Windows** users should open the start menu and run \"rpiboot-CM4-CM5 Mass "
"Storage Gadget\""
msgstr "**Windows** 用户打开开始菜单并运行「rpiboot-CM4-CM5 Mass Storage Gadget」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:61
#: 05144b5c2e054ee98abc448b8e24e0c2
msgid "run rpi-imager:"
msgstr "运行 rpi-imager："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:63
#: 2b576e3496ad4587956147f9e99035a6
msgid "**Ubuntu** users should open a terminal and enter \"rpi-imager\""
msgstr "**Ubuntu** 用户打开终端并输入「rpi-imager」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:64
#: 96a4850f1bbf45f79698d3fff437bbfb
msgid "**Windows** users should open from start menu run \"Raspberry Pi Imager\""
msgstr "**Windows** 用户从开始菜单运行「Raspberry Pi Imager」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:66
#: dee3707036dc4474b4c82d44f7b7b1b3
msgid "from within RPI Imager:"
msgstr "在 RPI Imager 中："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:68
#: 0b0dc8488ffe4ae2a4e1d2c474989b68
msgid "Choose Device: \"Raspberry Pi 4\" or \"Raspberry Pi 5\""
msgstr "选择设备：「Raspberry Pi 4」或「Raspberry Pi 5」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:69
#: a63a438fe8f5454bb5fd77a677f745d9
msgid "Operating System: Use custom, select downloaded .img file"
msgstr "Operating System：选择 Use custom，选中下载的 .img 文件"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:70
#: e9c65f28cddc408cbe0b01d41e331e0a
msgid "Storage: select RPI drive (should have appeared after rpiboot was run)"
msgstr "存储：选择 RPI 驱动器（运行 rpiboot 后应已出现）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:71
#: a33636e9fa264a44af7fcf15f77186e5
msgid "Select \"No\" when asked to apply special settings"
msgstr "询问是否应用特殊设置时选择「否」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:74
#: 6e2c208afb95456da2a9bd40ee3f9865
msgid "Configuring the Connection to the Autopilot"
msgstr "配置与飞控的连接"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:76
#: 53db2a67d6ea447bbeab050dac113637
msgid ""
"After the above installation is complete, perform the initial setup of "
"Rpanion Server"
msgstr "完成上述安装后，进行 Rpanion Server 的初始设置"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:78
#: ea169e1ef01e4249b6727799a299fe26
msgid ""
"Install the RPI on the Ochin Carrier Board connected to one of the "
"autopilot's serial ports as shown in the image at the top of this page"
msgstr "将 RPI 安装到 Ochin 载板上，并按本页顶部图片所示连接到飞控的某个串口"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:79
#: 7d41ec0531ce4f8fbdf8580d3f9e63db
msgid "Make sure a WiFi antenna is attached to the RPI"
msgstr "确保 RPI 上接有 WiFi 天线"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:80
#: 804cbb403ec24720a39683f2fd61e482
msgid "Connect to Rpanion Server via Wifi"
msgstr "通过 Wifi 连接到 Rpanion Server"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:82
#: 38c857c01d654208a8d7acef4278819a
msgid ""
"Wait for the \"rpanion\" wifi access point to appear and connect (password "
"is \"rpanion123\")"
msgstr "等待 \"rpanion\" wifi 接入点出现并连接（密码为 \"rpanion123\"）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:84
#: 851b75d1c4314adbbc1d05c979d9527a
msgid "Disable BlueTooth which may interfere with the RPI's serial ports"
msgstr "禁用蓝牙（BlueTooth），它可能干扰 RPI 的串口"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:86
#: ac9a850dc5e64be7a53ce9ced9bd5af0
msgid ""
"Use Putty (or any similar terminal program) to connect to the RPI using SSH"
msgstr "使用 Putty（或任何类似的终端程序）通过 SSH 连接到 RPI"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:88
#: d7c0eb9bf1a548c59a389bb50b6b7706
msgid "Host Name: 10.0.2.100"
msgstr "Host Name：10.0.2.100"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:89
#: 1bbba6a0131b4d8a856234e85d156f78
msgid "Connection Type: SSH"
msgstr "Connection Type：SSH"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:90
#: 04e3a2edfba643328f60b95e6064d0df
msgid "Port: 22"
msgstr "Port：22"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:91
#: 104ba8e8a0364d918d6e6e75ba22e50b
msgid "Username/password: pi/raspberry"
msgstr "用户名/密码：pi/raspberry"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:93
#: 4fc9ab6dcd1f44b4bd21cfcf3e8b8d23
msgid "Open /boot/firmware/config.txt with your favourite linux text editor:"
msgstr "用你喜欢的 linux 文本编辑器打开 /boot/firmware/config.txt："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:95
#: 05af77315e5e4c148e11332d5b39af40
msgid "sudo nano /boot/firmware/config.txt"
msgstr "sudo nano /boot/firmware/config.txt"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:96
#: f5ce75d2c90941139ca712df11301572
msgid "sudo vi /boot/firmware/config.txt"
msgstr "sudo vi /boot/firmware/config.txt"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:98
#: 485d0de6133f41d59ee7169c043d72f4
msgid "Add \"dtoverlay=disable-bt\" to the end of the file as shown below"
msgstr "如下图所示，在文件末尾添加 \"dtoverlay=disable-bt\""

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:106
#: 04cddaccab7349cc85cd315902cf02c8
msgid "Save and exit the text editor and reboot the RPI"
msgstr "保存并退出文本编辑器，然后重启 RPI"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:108
#: 6a63010a6cea4bf2b7c4f5da0b09d89e
msgid ""
"Open a browser to http://10.0.2.100:3001/ and enter username: admin, pw: "
"admin"
msgstr "用浏览器打开 http://10.0.2.100:3001/ ，输入用户名 admin、密码 admin"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:109
#: 59532e003ad34b848b16733748d1ebda
msgid "Select \"Flight Controller\" from the left menu"
msgstr "在左侧菜单中选择 \"Flight Controller\""

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:111
#: 16875adf044a409182473b7d7860a80e
msgid "Input Type: UART"
msgstr "Input Type：UART"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:112
#: 6febb57ead4e454aa34bd6c7c913c593
msgid ""
"Serial Device: /dev/serial0 (or whatever option appears in the drop-down)"
msgstr "Serial Device：/dev/serial0（或下拉框中出现的任一选项）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:113
#: 3467ce692da74b038bb22263b43f701d
msgid "Baud Rate: 921600"
msgstr "Baud Rate：921600"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:114
#: 2f80577145544380b1a0513ee7d9c9cc
msgid "MAVLink Version: 2.0"
msgstr "MAVLink Version：2.0"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:115
#: 832805bd35ee482d93f59dfdd38e3d9b
msgid ""
"Push the \"Start Telemetry\" button but note that no packets will be "
"received until the autopilot is configured as described below"
msgstr "点击 \"Start Telemetry\" 按钮，但注意在按下述方法配置好飞控之前不会收到任何数据包"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:117
#: 062e276b1e5a44d18b63265a7753a3f5
msgid ""
"Connect the autopilot to your PC with a USB cable and then connect with any "
"GCS (e.g. Mission Planner, QGC) and set the following parameters.  Please "
"note these assume Serial1 (aka Telem1) is physicall connected to the RPI:"
msgstr ""
"用 USB 线将飞控连接到 PC，然后用任意地面站（如 Mission Planner、QGC）连接并设置以下参数。请注意，这些设置假定 "
"Serial1（即 Telem1）物理连接到 RPI："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:119
#: cf7e821cc6f043548c6c2e76c2f258c9
msgid "SERIAL1_BAUD = 921 (921600 bps)"
msgstr "SERIAL1_BAUD = 921 (921600 bps)"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:120
#: 2353135cc72242019cc92424d5d40aaf
msgid "SERIAL1_PROTOCOL = 2 (MAVLink2)"
msgstr "SERIAL1_PROTOCOL = 2 (MAVLink2)"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:121
#: 380a06c727d84971b791c3cab8a7c60b
msgid "(Optionally) BRD_SER1_RTSCTS = 0 (Disable clear-to-send/ready-to-send)"
msgstr "（可选）BRD_SER1_RTSCTS = 0（禁用 clear-to-send/ready-to-send 流控）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:122
#: b5e479efd98d4917bb63f077170b8924
msgid ""
"Reboot the autopilot and check on Rpanion's Flight Controller screen that "
"mavlink packets are being received"
msgstr "重启飞控，并在 Rpanion 的 Flight Controller 页面确认正在收到 mavlink 数据包"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:124
#: 001fecc8a2de4e71a8480b8f2e8f94dd
msgid ""
"Confirm the ground station can connect to the autopilot through Rpanion's "
"Wifi AP"
msgstr "确认地面站可以通过 Rpanion 的 Wifi AP 连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:126
#: fbe6fb8541954467892899ef587cef6d
msgid "If using Mission Planner"
msgstr "如果使用 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:128
#: ae0d331429d24b7689fe7dde98575ad1
msgid "From the top-right of the screen select, \"UDPCl\" and press connect"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:129
#: ddfc8204ba6b4668a75fa26e4521e4b5
msgid "Enter host name/ip: 10.0.2.100"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:130
#: 6c521b6a42fe4f77997d49fa52d4367e
msgid "Enter remote port: 14550"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-install.rst:131
#: 4ccbf47f185945bdab791a954a367d9e
msgid "Press Connect"
msgstr ""
